@CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5092
# Set this to the id returned by Start run.
@runId = replace-with-run-id

### Liveness
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/health

### Readiness
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### Demo login (fictional credentials; no token/session)
POST {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo","password":"1234"}

### Home bootstrap
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/home

### Start run; copy response id into runId
POST {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs

### Active run
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/active

### Run by id
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}

### First overtake (+16 points)
PATCH {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMeters":1200,"durationSeconds":360}

### Second overtake (+14 points, 30 total)
PATCH {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMeters":2500,"durationSeconds":750}

### Third overtake (+11 points, 41 total)
PATCH {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMeters":4000,"durationSeconds":1200}

### Fourth overtake (+18 points, 59 total)
PATCH {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMeters":5500,"durationSeconds":1650}

### Finish run
POST {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/{{runId}}/finish
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceMeters":6800,"durationSeconds":2210}

### Home after finish
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/home

### Run history
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/runs/history?limit=10

### Personal progress
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/progress

### Today leaderboard
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/leaderboards/today

### Monthly leaderboard
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/leaderboards/month

### Current rival
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/rivals/current

### Next goal
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/goals/next

### Privacy-safe activity map
GET {{CitySurfers.Api_HostAddress}}/api/map/activity?period=today
